子打破了。疼，比三天前还疼，肚子里不停地翻搅着，战轻狂睁开双眼，顾不得休息，就被这疼痛折磨的不成样子，抚摸着高耸的小腹，战轻狂想缓解疼痛，却发现根本起不了作用。她没生过孩子，听说那是最痛的，与此时的她相比，也不过如此吧！疼的她想立刻拿把刀将肚子剖开，丫的，死男人，折磨她还不够吗？走了还将她弄成这样？疼痛传来，顾不得骂人，她抓住身边的石子，草根，土壤，只希望这样分散注意力，让肚子不那么疼。可是，没有用，她越想压制，痛感越加分明，仿佛有人拿刀一片片的刮着她身体里的器官，那是尖锐的疼；又好像是被无数大锤敲击着，钝疼钝疼的。实在受不住的人悲鸣一声，死死的揪住自己的头发，疼的满地打滚不说，大滴大滴的汗珠在地上砸下一小片汗迹，最后又被土壤给吸收了。蜜蜂嗡嗡嗡的声音吵的人心绪烦躁，让人恨不得把这里毁了才好。三天来，滴水未进，又消耗了大量的体力，被这疼痛折磨着，她真想一下了结自己算了，当初出任务时所受过的伤加在一起也抵不上现在所承受的痛苦。可是她战轻狂从来就不是服输的人，这天底下就没有过不去的坎儿！咬咬牙，擦了一把冷汗，哆哆嗦嗦的站起来，她必须离开这，找人来帮助她。刚将破碎的衣服披在身上，大喘了几口气，就一下子跌倒在地了。没力气了，难道她要成为世界上第一个被疼死的人吗？苦笑一下，然而肚子上的疼痛加剧，笑容一下僵固在脸上，连揉带搓，战轻狂疼的牙齿打颤，冷汗浸透了衣衫。躺在地上，佝偻着身体，她不断的对自己说，坚持，再坚持一下下，不能死，绝对不能死，难得的重生机会，一定要把握住，活着！一定要活着！不仅要活的精彩，还要成人人上人，站在这个大陆的顶端！就在这时，一道金光闪过，将战轻狂罩在其中，于是，林子里又一个大活人凭空消失了。“噗通”一声，战轻狂掉在了水里，瞬间的失重让她的头脑有些发蒙，摇摇头，她打量了一下周围，此时她正处在一片泉水中，连绵的山脉，群山环绕，除了泉水的声音，这里静的只剩她的呼吸声，直到看到不远处的一棵果子树，她才打起精神来，好久没吃东西了，现在就是给她一头牛，她都能一口吞下。起身刚离开泉水，被她忽略的肚子上的疼痛又传来，一下子单膝跪地。怎么回事？刚才不是不疼了吗，难道还没好，可是，该怎么办？灵光那么一闪，她突然想到，刚才是跌落在泉水里的，这泉水能缓解疼痛？抱着试一试的态度，轻狂又翻身回到泉水里。果然，肚子一点都不疼了，要不是鼓起来的部分，就和正常人没什么两样，难不成是这水有治愈的效果？不信邪的她离开重试了一下，排山倒海般的疼痛再次袭来，疼的人想怒吼几嗓子，然而事实却证实了她的猜想，这泉水果然不能离开。泡在泉水中，她不由得纳闷，这里是什么地方，原本她是在林子里的，怎么一下就到这儿了？还有这水，这山，究竟是怎么回事？正当她诧异时，脑中忽然出现几个大字——生命空间。生命空间？那是什么？就在她提问的时候，脑中又浮现很多字。生命空间，异次元空间，成型数亿万年，拥有无尽的生命元素，却没有生命的存在，只有生命泉水，生命果。生命泉水？生命果？每当她要提出疑问时，都会在脑中形成答案，可是她根本来不及想这是为什么，就被接下来的答案惊呆了！生命泉水，由“不朽泉眼”孕育而成，含有生命元素，具有洗筋伐髓、脱胎换骨的效果，能另伤者生肌化骨，修灵者增强灵力，修武者精炼机理，炼丹提高品级，炼器能随心化形。生命果，靠生命泉水滋养，含有生命元素，永远结一百个果子，味酸甜，有助于改善修灵者体质，有起死回生之效果。看着翻滚的泉眼，泉水一圈圈的散开，生生不息，最外圈的泉水正浇灌着生命果树。捡到宝了，战轻狂狡猾一笑，拥有这个生命空间，真是好处多多啊！可是，怎么才能变成她的，而且她是怎么来的？生命空间，生命力与生命元素相符者，拥有强大的信念，不弃己者，得之。被空间自主接纳之人，成为其主人，主人若为心善之人，则生命元素力量增强，若是大恶之人，则生命元素枯竭，直到空间消失。看到这儿，战轻狂明白了，也就是南宫轻狂身体里的生命力和这空间里的是一样的，可是她却没有坚持下去的心，白白放弃了自己的生命，而自己重生在她的身体里，靠着强大的信念想活下来，两人合二为一，才被这生命空间所接纳，所以，现在这空间的主人就是她了？哈哈哈，既然这样，那就看她怎样踏上强者之路，将那些看不起她，欺负过她的人都踩在脚下，废物？不能修炼灵力？开什么玩笑，等着吧！趁着还有时间，那些人多珍惜一下美好的时光吧！整理完思绪，战轻狂不得不面对一个尴尬的境况，那就是她饿了。可是，现在她离不开这泉水啊，人生最悲惨的事情是什么，是明明吃的就在你眼前，你却只能看着，咽着口水，动不得分毫。看着小肚子，她揉揉，戳戳，这到底是什么情况？她好饿啊！难倒要等到肚子消下去才行吗？于是，战轻狂惨兮兮的望着那颗生命果树，一个个的数啊！数过一遍又一遍。望梅止渴，画饼充饥也不过如此了吧！终于等到她数到八万六千个的时候，肚子由逐渐的变小，直至平坦。尝试性的将脚跨出泉水，没事，战轻狂拍拍胸口，小小的安慰自己一下，再跨出一只，全身都露出水面，总算没事了，简直太不容易了！只见她撒丫子就跑，目标正对着果树，一把将粗壮的树干抱在怀里，嚎啕大哭：“亲爱的果果，我可想死你了，么么。”顺便还亲了好几口。利落的爬上树，一手一个生命果，大口大口的吃在嘴里，边吃还露出傻兮兮满脸幸福的微笑。恩恩，真好吃，酸酸甜甜的，还有种说不出的清香，连着将果核儿都扔到嘴里，用手背擦了一下嘴角，又摘下两个，开心地吃着。而在她不注意的地方，瞬间又有四个生命果长出来，红艳艳的，煞是好看。填饱肚子的战轻狂恢复了往日的云淡风轻，看着浑身的伤口都完好如初，莹滑如玉，很是满意。可是衣服怎么办呢？还有，这生命空间怎么出去呢？哪知，她刚想到这里，人影一闪，马上就出现在消失的林子里，那个湖边。战轻狂顿时觉得一排乌鸦飞过，原来只要她那么随便一想，就可以出来了啊！可是也不是这样光溜溜的出来啊！看着手上的戒指，黑色复杂的图案嵌在上边，正泛着古老质朴的气息。哎，捡起沾满泥土，被撕碎的粉衣套在身上，战轻狂想总比没有的好，还是等天黑的时候，回到城里再说吧！想起害她如此的那几个少年，眼中冷光划过，她不会轻易就放过他们的！偏僻的湘城里小小的家族之子也敢在太岁头上动土，真是吃了雄心豹子胆了，还有吃里扒外的南宫连，伙同外人陷害她，都等着吧，她会让他们碎成渣渣，永存这天地之间的！至于那个男人，哼！虽然没能看清他的脸，可是，哪怕追到天涯海角，她也会让他生不如死的，就算救了她又如何，他敢说他没占到便宜吗？如今还把她扔在这里，让她自生自灭，这笔账，等找到他的时候，她会慢慢算的。看看日头西下，她要抓紧时间休息，等天黑了，就拿南宫连开刀，哼！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 Life Space War Qingkuang wants to kill someone right now. If she is awake, she will definitely use Foshan Shadowless Kick to kick him like a red flower! Performing all the ten tortures of the Qing Dynasty again, who is she fighting Qing Kuang? The dignified head of the Zhan family, is he so aggrieved today? There is a saying that it is never too late for a \"little girl\" to take revenge in ten years! Don't let this person seize the opportunity, or she will torture him to death! Before falling into darkness, I could still hear a man's voice in a daze. \"Today, you offended me. I originally wanted to make your life worse than death. However, because you have been the only human being who can cause me to behave strangely for thousands of years, I let you go. Whether you can survive depends on your own destiny...\" The voice gradually faded away until it disappeared. If anyone were here, they would definitely be surprised that a large living person just disappeared little by little. Zhan Qingkuang, who was in a coma, didn't take the man seriously at all. She secretly swore, dead man, what do you mean by making my life worse than death? If you have the guts, don't leave. I'll torture you to death in minutes. Believe it or not! Don't let me see you again, she remembered today's shame! If we meet again, she will definitely avenge her, and if she wants revenge, she will bite you to death or maim you! The air is fresh, the leaves are rustled by the wind, and occasionally bring bursts of floral fragrance, the bees are busy collecting honey, and the butterflies are flying lightly. The birds sang happily, and their clever little eyes looked at the human being lying on the ground, exchanging words with each other. It was originally a beautiful picture, but it was completely broken by the trembling woman by the lake. The pain was worse than three days ago. His stomach was churning constantly. Zhan Qingkuang opened his eyes and couldn't rest. He was tortured by the pain. He stroked his high abdomen and tried to relieve the pain, but found that it didn't work at all. She had never given birth, and I heard that it was the most painful. Compared with her at this time, it was nothing more than that! The pain was so bad that she wanted to take a knife and cut open her stomach immediately. Damn it, damn man, wasn't torture enough for her? Will she be left like this after leaving? The pain came, and she didn't care about cursing. She grabbed the stones, grass roots, and soil around her, hoping to distract her attention and make her stomach less painful. But it was no use. The more she tried to suppress it, the more distinct the pain became. It was as if someone was using a knife to scrape the organs in her body piece by piece. It was a sharp pain; it was also like being hit by countless sledgehammers, which was a dull pain. Those who couldn't bear it let out a scream and grabbed their hair tightly, rolling on the ground in pain. Large drops of sweat left a small stain on the ground, which was finally absorbed by the soil. The buzzing sound of bees makes people feel irritable and makes them want to destroy the place. For three days, she had not had any water, and had consumed a lot of energy. She was tortured by this pain. She really wanted to kill herself. The injuries she suffered when she went on the mission together were not worth the pain she was suffering now. But she has never been one to admit defeat when fighting against Qing Kuang. There is no obstacle in the world that she cannot overcome! Gritting her teeth, wiping away some cold sweat, she stood up shivering. She had to leave here and find someone to help her. As soon as he put the broken clothes on his body and took a few deep breaths, he suddenly fell to the ground. She has no strength left, is she going to be the first person in the world to be hurt to death? He smiled bitterly, but the pain in his stomach intensified, and the smile froze on his face. He rubbed and rubbed, and his teeth chattered in pain, and his clothes were soaked in cold sweat. Lying on the ground, hunched over, she kept saying to herself, hold on, hold on a little longer, you can't die, you absolutely can't die, you must seize this rare opportunity to be reborn and live! Must live! Not only must you live a wonderful life, but you must also become a master and stand at the top of this continent! At this moment, a golden light flashed, covering Zhan Qingkuang, and then, another living person in the forest disappeared out of thin air. With a \"pop\", Zhan Qingkuang fell into the water. The momentary weightlessness made her brain a little dazed. She shook her head and looked around. At this time, she was in a spring, surrounded by rolling mountains. Except for the sound of the spring, the only sound left here was her breathing. It wasn't until she saw a fruit tree not far away that she cheered up. She hadn't eaten for a long time, and now even if she was given a cow, she could swallow it in one gulp. As soon as she got up and left the spring, the pain in her stomach that she ignored came again, and she suddenly fell to one knee. What's going on? Didn’t the pain stop just now? Isn’t it better yet? But, what should I do? With a flash of inspiration, she suddenly thought that she had fallen into the spring water just now. Can this spring water relieve the pain? With the attitude of giving it a try, Qing Kuang turned over and returned to the spring water. Sure enough, my stomach didn't hurt at all. If it weren't for the bulging part, it would be no different from a normal person. Could it be that this water has a healing effect? Not believing in evil, she left and tried again, but the overwhelming pain hit her again. The pain made her want to roar a few times, but the facts confirmed her suspicion that she couldn't leave this spring. While soaking in the spring water, she couldn't help but wonder, where is this place? She was originally in the woods, how did she end up here all of a sudden? And what is going on with this water and this mountain? Just when she was surprised, a few big words suddenly appeared in her mind - Life Space. Life space? What is that? Just as she was asking questions, many words came to mind. Life space, a different-dimensional space, has been formed for hundreds of millions of years. It has endless life elements, but there is no existence of life, only life spring water and life fruit. Fountain of life? Life fruit? Whenever she wanted to ask a question, she would form an answer in her mind, but before she had time to think about why, she was stunned by the next answer! The spring of life is bred from the \"Immortal Spring\" and contains life elements. It has the effect of washing muscles, cutting marrow, and regenerating bones. It can regenerate muscles and bones of the injured and repair them.", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}